  "plain": "A filmmaker and journalist, Jeremy Corbell, says that different pieces of so-called legacy hardware, meaning craft or material said to be recovered long ago, are kept in different places around the United States. He says it is public that a member of Congress, Representative Burlison, has been going to various sites in search of this hardware, which if true would mean lawmakers are chasing physical proof."
